# /employers/ — the public Employer Enquiry entry point.
#
# This file is kept intentionally minimal. The only directive is
# DirectoryIndex, which needs AllowOverride Indexes — the broadest
# permission category and the one cPanel enables by default on
# every account. Options and FilesMatch were removed because they
# need AllowOverride Options / Limit, which some shared-host vhost
# configs refuse; when Apache rejects a directive it 500s the
# whole directory, and the proxy in front often surfaces that as
# a 404 (which is what was being seen).
#
# If directory listing needs to be blocked, set it on the vhost
# instead of here — /employers/ already has an index.php so the
# listing never shows up in practice.

DirectoryIndex index.php
